{"title":"Welcome to HERA","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Welcome to HERA","format":"html"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>Empowering Health Economics</h1>\n<h2>Your Partner in Health Economics & Regulatory Affairs</h2>\n<p>Evidence-Based Decision Support for Health and Policy</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"app.qmd\">Launch HERA App</a>\n\n<div class=\"video-container\">\n<video width=\"100%\" controls>\n<source src=\"images/HERA App_ Health Economics Modeling Simplified_720p_caption.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n</div>\n::: callout-note\n**Disclaimer:** The HERA App helps decision‑makers evaluate interventions using incremental cost‑effectiveness and uncertainty analysis. HERA App is intended for research and educational use only.\n:::\n\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>What We Do</h2>\n:::: {.features}\n💡 **Health-Economic Modeling**\nDevelop easy-to-use models to support policy and clinical decisions.\n\n𓃠 **Agile and Interactive Exploration**\nProvide tools for exploring cost-effectiveness and uncertainty.\n\n🧠 **Transparency & Reproducibility**\nPromote open, reliable, and reproducible modeling practices.\n::::\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section dark\">\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<p>Deliver rigorous, transparent, and accessible health-economic models that empower evidence-based decisions in policy, research, and regulation.</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"grid-section\">\n🎯 **Decision Support**\nCustom cost-effectiveness and HTA modeling tools for timely insights.\n\n🌍 **Regulatory Affairs**\nEvidence synthesis and analytic frameworks aligned with global HTA guidelines.\n</div>\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>Empowering Health Economics</h1>\n<h2>Your Partner in Health Economics & Regulatory Affairs</h2>\n<p>Evidence-Based Decision Support for Health and Policy</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"app.qmd\">Launch HERA App</a>\n\n<div class=\"video-container\">\n<video width=\"100%\" controls>\n<source src=\"images/HERA App_ Health Economics Modeling Simplified_720p_caption.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n</div>\n::: callout-note\n**Disclaimer:** The HERA App helps decision‑makers evaluate interventions using incremental cost‑effectiveness and uncertainty analysis. HERA App is intended for research and educational use only.\n:::\n\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>What We Do</h2>\n:::: {.features}\n💡 **Health-Economic Modeling**\nDevelop easy-to-use models to support policy and clinical decisions.\n\n𓃠 **Agile and Interactive Exploration**\nProvide tools for exploring cost-effectiveness and uncertainty.\n\n🧠 **Transparency & Reproducibility**\nPromote open, reliable, and reproducible modeling practices.\n::::\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section dark\">\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<p>Deliver rigorous, transparent, and accessible health-economic models that empower evidence-based decisions in policy, research, and regulation.</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"grid-section\">\n🎯 **Decision Support**\nCustom cost-effectiveness and HTA modeling tools for timely insights.\n\n🌍 **Regulatory Affairs**\nEvidence synthesis and analytic frameworks aligned with global HTA guidelines.\n</div>\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"outp